+/* MS Learn DXGI_FORMAT_NV12: "Valid luminance data view formats for this video resource format are DXGI_FORMAT_R8_UNORM
+ * and DXGI_FORMAT_R8_UINT. Valid chrominance data view formats (width and height are each 1/2 of luminance view) ...
